WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.080
Rent is up.

00:00:01.080 --> 00:00:02.200
Food is up.

00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:03.650
Transport too.

00:00:03.650 --> 00:00:05.100
It's exhausting.

00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:09.520
International remote roles open the door to foreign-currency earnings.

00:00:09.520 --> 00:00:12.230
That can mean more spending power in naira.

00:00:12.230 --> 00:00:16.390
OpenRemote Match helps you find relevant roles open to Nigeria.

00:00:16.390 --> 00:00:18.200
With practical help to apply.

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:21.000
See how it works.

